        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo BTS-160-PC, T-Strike Hole Frame Filler Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\"T\" strike plate hole frame filler plate. Normally used on metal frame doors to cover the frame hole when a <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device</b></a> is used on the door. Fits T-strike 160 cut out (standard T strike).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-BTS-160-specifications.gif?v=1704354777\" width=\"232\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo T-strike Hole Frame Filler Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo BTS-160-PC T Strike Filler Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .090\" (13 Gauge)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Primer</li>\r\n<li>Screws: 2 each #8-32 x 1/2\" Machine Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-BTS-160-PC-specifications.pdf?v=1704262312\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo BTS-160-PC Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
